<p>Hi <%= @preferred_name %>,</p>

<p>You'd already finished your registration for <%= @event_name %>, but the event team has since changed what the event needs from everyone. Before your registration is confirmed again, we need:</p>

<ul>
  <% @missing.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>Everything else you gave us is still saved. Your entry ticket will be back as soon as this is filled in.</p>

<p style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <%= mail_button "Update Your Registration", @link %>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, reach out to <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
